%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "16px"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant D as 👨‍⚕️ Doctor
    participant PC as 🎮 PrescriptionsController
    participant PS as 💊 PrescriptionsService
    participant PR as 🗄️ PrismaService
    participant DB as 🐘 PostgreSQL

    Note over D,DB: FLUJO: CREAR PRESCRIPCIÓN

    D->>PC: POST /prescriptions {patientId?, patientEmail, items, notes}
    PC->>PS: create(dto, authorId from JWT)
    PS->>PS: Validar patientId o patientEmail

    alt patientId proporcionado
        PS->>PR: patient.findUnique(patientId)
        PR->>DB: SELECT * FROM patient WHERE id=?
    else patientEmail proporcionado
        PS->>PR: patient.findFirst(where: user.email = patientEmail)
        PR->>DB: SELECT p.* FROM patient p JOIN user u ON p.userId = u.id WHERE u.email=?
    end

    DB-->>PR: Patient | null
    PR-->>PS: Patient

    alt Paciente no encontrado
        PS-->>D: 404 "Paciente no encontrado"
    end

    PS->>PS: Generar código único: PRESC-{timestamp36}
    PS->>PR: prescription.create({code, items, patientId, authorId})
    PR->>DB: INSERT INTO prescription + INSERT INTO prescription_item (batch)
    DB-->>PR: Prescription + PrescriptionItems
    PR-->>PS: Prescription con items cargados
    PS-->>D: Prescription (201)

    Note over D,DB: FLUJO: VER PRESCRIPCIONES (patient)

    participant Pt as 👤 Patient
    participant PtC as 🎮 PrescriptionsController
    participant PtS as 💊 PrescriptionsService

    Pt->>PtC: GET /prescriptions (JWT con rol=patient)
    PtC->>PtS: findAll(pagination, userId, "patient", null, patientId)
    PtS->>PR: prescription.findMany({ where: { patientId: patientId } })
    PR->>DB: SELECT * FROM prescription WHERE patientId=? LIMIT ? OFFSET ?
    DB-->>PR: Prescription[]
    PR-->>PtS: Prescription[]
    PtS-->>PtC: {data: [...], meta: {page, limit, total, totalPages}}
    PtC-->>Pt: {data: [...], meta: {...}}

    Note over D,DB: FLUJO: CONSUMIR PRESCRIPCIÓN

    Pt->>PtC: PATCH /prescriptions/:id/consume
    PtC->>PtS: consume(prescriptionId, patientId)
    PtS->>PR: prescription.findUnique(id)
    PR->>DB: SELECT * FROM prescription WHERE id=?
    DB-->>PR: Prescription
    alt No es el dueño
        PtS-->>Pt: 403 "Solo el paciente puede marcar como consumida"
    end
    alt Ya consumida
        PtS-->>Pt: 400 "Ya está marcada como consumida"
    end
    PtS->>PR: prescription.update(status: "consumed", consumedAt: now)
    PR->>DB: UPDATE prescription SET status='consumed', consumedAt=now
    PtS-->>Pt: Prescription actualizada